    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game follows the simple drag and shoot method.</h2> <strong>Blue Alien</strong> is the main hero. After the collision with the enemy, the health of the blue alien will increase and the score will update. But if he hit by bullets, his health will decrease. <strong>Each enemy will respawn after a limited period of time at any random location.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy Characteristics:</h2></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-1:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/7897cbd30df6bce49cdbb08893ee0707.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Easy</i><br>Hit damage : 1<br>Score and health will increase 1 after it destroyed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-2</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/e5cad16c98d38e0c5161c1dfeebe7cd7.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Medium</i><br>Hit damage : 3<br>Score and health will increase 2 after it destroyed.<br>It will continue to follow the blue fish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-3:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/d4afb954cb2ec15143891a85a393a550.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Hard</i><br>Hit damage : 0.8<br>Score and health will increase 3 after it destroyed.<br>High rate of fire.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-4:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/249423578c4d782a23c691210446d9f8.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Extreme</i><br>Hit damage : 0.8<br>Score and health will increase 4 after it destroyed.<br>High rate of fire<br>It will continue to follow the blue fish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-5:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/10d3a4844d0d3717a79dfd0b2bd9df09.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Medium</i><br>Hit damage : 4<br>Fast Movement Speed<br>Score will increase 3 and health will increase 4 after it destroyed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-6:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/eaeb5729b771a69c14ad5fe8086b5d46.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Extreme</i><br><strong>Hit Damage -</strong><br><u>Small Size Bullet : 2</u><br><u>Medium Size Bullet : 3</u><br><u>Big Size Bullet : 5</u><br>Super fast Movement Speed<br>Score and health will increase 5 after it destroyed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemy-7:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/f3205480cc4dd40f655bb4d6942e4539.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br><i>Level : Hard</i><br>Hit damage : 10<br>Score and health will increase 3 after it destroyed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Healer:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271920/extras/19812ef8ca91ab5b6275b4fd8e686778.avif?t=1697558020\" /></span><br>If the bullet hit Blue fish its health will increase 5.<br><br>       More Enemy Will Add too Soon.....",
